          "brief": "A colossal offering horse built from stripped pine and oak ship timbers on heavy wheeled log rollers. The towering wooden frame has dark planks, subtle secret trapdoor seams beneath its belly, a carved equine head, and festive votive wreaths hung on its flanks.",
