          "id": "citadel_of_priam",
          "mode": "landmark",
          "brief": "The high royal megaron palace of King Priam: monumental sun-clay ashlar walls, a deep columned portico with two massive stone pillars, an open bronze hearth hall within, and stepped crenellated parapets overlooking the city roofs.",
